WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Imisozi yari ituje muri icyo gihe cy'imbeho.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Nagusezeranyije ko nzakubona, n'iyo byaba kure gute.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Buri nzira nanyuragamo yarushagaho kuntandukanya n'iwacu.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Uracyibuka indirimbo nyogokuru yaririmbaga?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Guma hafi yanjye. Umuyaga uraje.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Hari inkuru zitwarwa, ntizivugwe.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.500
Turi abanyembaraga iyo turi hamwe kuruta igihe twatandukanye.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Iyi ni intangiriro gusa.
